      455.04,
      562.3,
      525.11
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media, of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this orderimpose, in respect of the list of commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at therates specified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule. This Order shall be valid for a period of 06 monthscommencing from 16th August, 2017, subject to provisions of Sub Section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity LevyAct No. 48 of 2007.",
